    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "One mail, end to end",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "\n- **Path**: API handler returns `OutgoingMessages` → durable outbox → `x.emails` (topic) → `q.emails.<domain>` → **hr-notification-worker** → idempotency claim → liquid render → SMTP (locally [Mailpit](http://localhost:8025)).\n- **Healthy**: *Sent* grows with traffic, *Failed* and *Dead letters* 0, backlog near 0, *Publish → sent* well under a second, every health check green.\n- **SMTP down**: *Failed* rises, deliveries are retried (1 s, 5 s, 15 s) and then dead-lettered; health stays green (SMTP is not a readiness check), so watch *Failed*.\n- **Worker down**: *Worker instances* 0, backlog grows, *Consumers by queue* 0.\n- **Duplicates**: redeliveries caught by `notifications.processed_events` - no second mail left the building.\n- **One mail's story**: find the request in [Rootprint → Traces](http://localhost:8282/traces) (service `hr-api`), the same trace continues in `hr-notification-worker` through the message headers.\n- Traffic: `./infrastructure/start.sh --emails`.\n"
      },
      "id": 30,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 46
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      }
    }
